{"pageid":3862,"title":"GrUdge","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">GrUdge</span>","revid":17565,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"grUdge\">grUdge</span></h2>\n<p>grUdge is a pink pig-like animal that has a 1 in 777 (0.129%) chance of spawning when a player opens a <a href=\"/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates\" title=\"Box Of Chocolates\">Box of Chocolates</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>grUdge is the only non-chocolate related item in the <a href=\"/wiki/Box_Of_Chocolates\" title=\"Box Of Chocolates\">Box of Chocolates</a><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 338px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1b/GrUdge.png/revision/latest?cb=20260513073310\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rare grUdge from Box Of Chocolate\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1b/GrUdge.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/338?cb=20260513073310\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"338\" height=\"270\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"GrUdge.png\" data-image-key=\"GrUdge.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:GrUdge.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Rare grUdge from Box Of Chocolate</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></li></ul>\n<ul><li>There is a hostile mob version of grUdge that spawns in the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>, which attacks you and inflicts 75 health units. It drops <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">?&#160;?&#160;?</a> after you killed it.</li></ul>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-def